@startuml UC-32
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-32.md
title UC-32: Select Shipping Address
footer Feature CHK-01 | Business rules: BR-08, BR-09, BR-28
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "CheckoutController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "CheckoutService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open checkout
MVC -> API : GET /api/checkout (Bearer token)
API -> SVC : GetCheckoutAsync(currentUserId)
SVC -> DB : Load selected cart lines + current prices (BR-23)
SVC -> DB : Load addresses WHERE UserId = current user\nORDER BY IsDefault DESC (BR-08, BR-09)
SVC -> SVC : Calculate totals (BR-24)
SVC --> API : CheckoutDto (items, addresses, totals)
API --> MVC : 200 OK
alt customer has no address
  MVC --> U : Ask to add an address
  ref over U, MVC : UC-11 Add / Update / Delete Address
else has addresses
  MVC --> U : Show addresses with default preselected
  U -> MVC : Keep default or choose another address
  MVC -> MVC : Keep chosen addressId for Place Order
end
note over MVC : The address is copied into the order\nwhen it is placed (BR-28, UC-34 / UC-35)

@enduml
